Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] media: mediatek: adapt the VCP decoder backend to MT6897

Adapt the imported decoder to MT6897 firmware layouts, bounded DMA
apertures, ring ownership and retained bitstream inputs. Support the
negotiated formats and reject unsupported compressed capture layouts.

